<title>LEBANON: SOLIDERE shares up on Beirut bourse.</title>
<headline>SOLIDERE shares up on Beirut bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOLIDERE shares rose on Wednesday on the Beirut Stock exchange (BSE).</p>
<p>A shares rose to $111.75 from Tuesday's $110, and B shares rose to $113.625 from $109.750.</p>
<p>Turnover was 2,358 shares down from Tuesday's 2,951, and the value of traded shares was $262,427.625 from $325,612.125.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index was up 0.72 percent to 83.92 and the BLOM stock index rose 2.06 percent to 962.92.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456</p>
</text>
